camera: capture image and class histogram.
STEP 7
navigator: if a container centroid was reported in step 6, drive to an approach pose at least 3 m from the container centroid (offset toward last known pose/spawn); otherwise drive to viewpoint D (alternate search pose). If nav fails, use occupancy map to pick another free cell and drive there.
lidar: wait.
camera: wait.
